# Cook-a-roon's draws: a level 75 Warrior in Nashmau with twelve of each fish (Ahtapot and Istavrit1 do not stack:
# a row each), the quest accepted (a GM). Five unpinned accepted draws (2: the stew, 3: none; completed either way,
# the fish taken) and four unpinned completed ones (update 243: the fish taken, Prog 0): both 2 and 3 come up on each
# side in the trace, so the draw range and the Prog it sets show. Then the pinned draws at 3: the five fish: 243 ([7] =
# the draw), a GM pins Prog 3; finished: no stew; completed; the fish taken. Completed: the five fish: 243, a GM pins
# Prog 3; update 243: the fish taken, no stew, Prog 0; finished. The five fish again: 243 ([7] = the draw), finished
# with no update: no handler: the fish kept (the completed section confirms in its update only; the trade stays open,
# so it is the last).
lists Nashmau/Ququroon/onTrade Nashmau/onEventFinish/243 Nashmau/onEventUpdate/243
char zone=Nashmau pos=-0.9,0,66.824 job=WAR lvl=75
item Ahtapot
item Ahtapot
item Ahtapot
item Ahtapot
item Ahtapot
item Ahtapot
item Ahtapot
item Ahtapot
item Ahtapot
item Ahtapot
item Ahtapot
item Ahtapot
item Istakoz x12
item Istavrit1
item Istavrit1
item Istavrit1
item Istavrit1
item Istavrit1
item Istavrit1
item Istavrit1
item Istavrit1
item Istavrit1
item Istavrit1
item Istavrit1
item Istavrit1
item Istiridye x12
item Mercanbaligi x12
quest AhtUrhgan.CookARoon accepted
login
# accepted: the draw, unpinned (2 or 3; the trace records it)
trade Ququroon Ahtapot x1 Istakoz x1 Istavrit1 x1 Istiridye x1 Mercanbaligi x1
finish                                  # completed; the fish taken (the stew at 2 only)
quest AhtUrhgan.CookARoon available   # a GM
quest AhtUrhgan.CookARoon accepted
# accepted: the draw, unpinned (2 or 3; the trace records it)
